msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:491
msgid ""
"`confirm` (boolean, optional): Whether to ask for confirmation before "
"pushing. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr ""

