msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:505
msgid ""
"The returned table contains `ok`, `refspecs`, and `rejected`. Each rejected "
"entry contains `reference` and `message`."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:508
